{"kind": "mod", "id": 1115, "name": "Tarkov Stash", "slug": "tarkov-stash", "teaser": "Edit your stash items", "owner_name": "agavalda", "downloads": 15311, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Apache License 2.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:51.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-10-16T16:58:33.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-10-16T16:58:33.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/apache-2.0/", "description_html": "<p><strong>If you just need to add items into your stash you might want to checkout my other mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2207-give-ui/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">give-ui</a>, it’s simpler and allows to add items while Tarkov is running.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For 3.11 download 2.x versions</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For 3.10 download 1.x versions</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For 3.9 download 0.13.x versions</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For 3.8.1/2/3 download 0.11.x versions</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For 3.8.0 download 0.10.x versions</strong></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">About</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/master/0.13.0.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/master/0.13.0.png\" alt=\"0.13.0.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>Edit your stash visually:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup your profile</li>\n<li>Set <em>found in raid</em> to items</li>\n<li>Increase stock of items (currency, ammo)</li>\n<li>Restore durability, usage etc from armors, keys, meds…</li>\n<li>Open containers and backpacks (internal layout might be wrong)</li>\n<li>Add items into your stash (beta)</li>\n<li>Add weapons presets into your stash (beta)</li>\n<li>See weapons attachments</li>\n<li>Delete items</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please check <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash</a> for known issues</p>\n<p>Everytime you make a change a backup from your profile is created in your profile folder, you can always delete the broken profile and restore the latest working backup.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Screenshots</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>version 0.8.0, items images loaded by default:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/0.8.0.png?raw=true\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/0.8.0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"0.8.0.png?raw=true\" /></a></p>\n<p>version 0.9.0, items loaded from cache icon folder:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/0.9.0.png?raw=true\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/0.9.0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"0.9.0.png?raw=true\" /></a></p>\n<p>add preset feature:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/raw/master/0.6.0.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/raw/master/0.6.0.png\" alt=\"0.6.0.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>open containers feature:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/master/gif-container.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/master/gif-container.gif\" alt=\"gif-container.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/screen-0.1.4.png?raw=true\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/blob/master/screen-0.1.4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"screen-0.1.4.png?raw=true\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation and Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation:</p>\n<p><strong>Remember to delete the previous version when unzipping a new version</strong></p>\n<p>Unzip the file into your SPT folder, you will find an executable inside user/mods/tarkov-stash folder</p>\n<p>Requirements:</p>\n<p>- webview is installed: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://support.templafy.com/hc/en-us/articles/360017470437-How-to-check-for-and-install-WebView2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://support.templafy.com/hc/en-us/articles/360017470437-How-to-check-for-and-install-WebView2</a></p>\n<p>- FIKA is NOT supported</p>\n<p><strong>BEFORE YOU OPEN A COMPLAIN:</strong></p>\n<p>- be sure to use the latest version</p>\n<p>- stop SPT server</p>\n<p>- start SPT server</p>\n<p>- start the mod</p>\n<p>- reproduce the issue</p>\n<p>- attach to the comment: SPT server log, mod log (you can find it the help menu) and ALL your profiles</p>\n<p>It’s a beta version so expect few issues here and there, if you find any, please fill a bug here <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash/</a> or add a comment!</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.7.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, 